  "notes": "DOM order on home: the absolutely-positioned logo zone and the fixed mobile header bar render BEFORE the splash (Home.jsx:110-111); the flowing header bar (headerCont) renders after it, which is the position TEMPLATE_SEQUENCE and HEADER_POSITION encode. variant 'home' = sticky scroll-scaled logo + in-page anchor nav (onNavigate); variant 'legal' = static 0.6666 logo linking to / and nav hrefs '/#id' (full navigation back to home)."
